&lt;h2 id=&#34;technical-stack&#34;&gt;Technical stack
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://vuejs.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Vue.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.djangoproject.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Python / Django&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLM Framework：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.langchain.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LangChain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.postgresql.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostgreSQL + pgvector&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
